
### R10-1. Create large room (capacity 11)
# @name createLargeRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Large room", "capacity": 11 }

###
@largeRoomId = {{createLargeRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### R10-2. Large room, exactly 2 hours (expected 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{largeRoomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "dan", "startUtc": "2030-04-01T08:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-04-01T10:00:00Z", "attendees": 5 }

### R10-3. Large room, 2h01 (expected 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{largeRoomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "dan", "startUtc": "2030-04-02T08:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-04-02T10:01:00Z", "attendees": 5 }

### R10-4. Normal room (capacity 10), exactly 4 hours (expected 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

